### AfriDev Hub — REST Client (VS Code)
### Extension requise : REST Client (humao.rest-client)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

# ─── Variables dynamiques ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Remplace après login
@accessToken  = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@refreshToken = PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE

# IDs à remplir au fil des tests
@userId       = PASTE_USER_ID_HERE
@postId       = PASTE_POST_ID_HERE
@answerId     = PASTE_ANSWER_ID_HERE
@projectId    = PASTE_PROJECT_ID_HERE
@jobId        = PASTE_JOB_ID_HERE


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AUTH
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### [Story 2.1] Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "idy_dev",
  "email": "idy@gtech.sn",
  "password": "Secret123!",
  "fullName": "Idrissa Wade"
}

###

### [Story 2.1] Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "idy@gtech.sn",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

###

### Refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# USERS / PROFILES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### [Story 2.1] Get public profile (tracer bullet)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/idy_dev

###

### Get profile by username
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Update my profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bio": "Fullstack Dev — GTECH Sénégal",
  "country": "SN",
  "githubUrl": "https://github.com/TheShvdow"
}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# FORUM — Posts
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### List posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts

###

### Get post by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}

###

### Create post
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Comment configurer Prisma avec Neon sur NestJS ?",
  "content": "J'essaie de connecter Prisma 5 à Neon DB dans un monorepo Nx…",
  "tags": ["prisma", "nestjs", "neon"]
}

###

### Update post
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Comment configurer Prisma 5 avec Neon sur NestJS 10 ?",
  "content": "Contenu mis à jour…"
}

###

### Delete post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# FORUM — Answers
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Create answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/posts/{{postId}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "content": "Tu dois ajouter `directUrl` dans le schema Prisma pour Neon…"
}

###

### Accept answer
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/forum/answers/{{answerId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Delete answer
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/forum/answers/{{answerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# VOTES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Vote UP on a post
POST {{baseUrl}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "entityType": "POST",
  "entityId": "{{postId}}",
  "value": "UP"
}

###

### Vote DOWN on an answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "entityType": "ANSWER",
  "entityId": "{{answerId}}",
  "value": "DOWN"
}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PROJECTS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### List projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

###

### Get project by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}

###

### Create project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "AfriDev Hub",
  "description": "Plateforme communautaire pour les devs africains",
  "repoUrl": "https://github.com/TheShvdow/afridev_hub",
  "stack": ["NestJS", "Prisma", "PostgreSQL", "Angular"],
  "country": "SN"
}

###

### Update project
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "description": "Description mise à jour"
}

###

### Star / unstar project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/star
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Delete project
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Admin] List pending projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Admin] Approve project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [Admin] Reject project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# JOBS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### List jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs

###

### Get job by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}

###

### Create job
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Développeur NestJS Senior",
  "description": "Nous recherchons un dev NestJS expérimenté…",
  "company": "GTECH Sénégal",
  "location": "SN",
  "mode": "REMOTE",
  "stack": ["NestJS", "PostgreSQL", "Docker"],
  "salaryMin": 500000,
  "salaryMax": 800000
}

###

### Update job
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Développeur NestJS & Prisma Senior"
}

###

### Close job
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Apply to job
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "Motivé par ce poste, 3 ans d'expérience NestJS.",
  "cvUrl": "https://idrissawade.com/cv.pdf"
}

###

### [Recruiter] Get applications for a job
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
